{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14247","headline":"奉送职方崔员外摄中丞新罗册使 · 窦常","name":"奉送职方崔员外摄中丞新罗册使","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"帝命海东使，人行天一涯。\n辨方知木德，开国有金家。\n册拜申恩重，留欢作限赊。\n顺风鲸浪热，初日锦帆斜。\n夜色潜然火，秋期独往槎。\n慰安皆喻旨，忠信自无瑕。\n发美童年髻，簪香子月花。\n便随琛賮入，正朔在中华。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"窦常","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14247.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14247","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}